---
import Img_invitacion from '../../assets/img/filters_format(avif).avif';
import Img_Frase from '../../assets/img/the-shape-of-purpose.svg';
---

<div class="w-[full] h-[100vh] bg-black mt-[60vh] text-white flex">
  <img src={Img_invitacion.src} alt="" class="h-full">
  <div class="flex-1 p-[8rem]">
    <p class="text-[5vw] leading-none">FORM <br> FOLLOWS <br> FUNCTION.</p>
    <img src={Img_Frase.src} alt="" class="w-full my-[2rem]">
    <p>The wraparound main line connects the light signatures at the front and rear. Distinctive torpedo-style fenders and the dynamic roofline draw on historic Porsche design features and reinterpret them.</p>
  </div>
</div>